    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the maintenance guy just looked at the logs and said the cooling compressor seemed to cut out for no reason, almost like it was manually toggled off or something glitched it. he can't find any physical damage to the wiring or any obvious reason why it would just stop working like that. any idea why a machine would just fail suddenly without any error codes or physical signs of wear?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
